@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DD
skinparam noteBorderColor #D6B65C
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
title 建议：目录先显示，内容按资源独立读取
participant "应用 / Playback" as app
participant MediaLibrary as library
database "目录库 / 资源索引" as catalog
participant ContentAccess as access
database "分段音频缓存" as cache
participant SourceAdapter as source
participant "远端" as remote
app -> library : observeCatalog()
library -> catalog : 读取持久化目录
catalog --> app : 立即显示已有歌曲及缓存状态
library ->> source : 后台 refresh()
app -> access : open(mediaKey, revision)
access -> catalog : 定位资源与本地覆盖范围
access -> cache : 检查所需区间
alt 本地已覆盖
  cache --> access : 本地区间
  access --> app : ContentHandle（无需远端就绪）
else 存在缺口
  access -> source : locate / refreshCredentials
  source -> remote : 取得资源、鉴权或刷新地址
  source --> access : descriptor + capabilities
  access -> remote : 请求实际所需字节范围
  remote --> cache : 校验版本后提交区间
  access --> app : ContentHandle
end
source -->> library : ScanResult(scope, complete, revision)
library -> catalog : 只在确认完整的范围内对账
note over access, remote
定位由解封装器提供需要的范围；服务端不支持 Range 时显式降级。
缓存与目录按账号、来源、稳定身份和内容版本隔离。
end note

@enduml
